<title>UK: World Bank doubles two-year rand Eurobond.</title>
<headline>World Bank doubles two-year rand Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Hambros Bank Ltd, has been increased to 200 million rand from 100 million rand.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.0	MATURITY    12.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.738   PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
